---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { company, services } from '../data';
---
<Layout title="Let’s discuss your workforce" description="Prepare a workforce enquiry for Victoria Foreign Employment, or contact the team directly by WhatsApp or email.">
  <section class="page-heading container contact-heading"><p class="eyebrow">LET’S TALK</p><h1>Tell us about<br/><em>the work ahead.</em></h1><div class="page-heading-bottom"><p>A few details are all it takes to start a useful conversation. Prepare your brief below, then send it using WhatsApp or email.</p></div></section>
  <section class="container contact-layout section">
    <aside class="contact-aside"><p class="eyebrow">A DIRECT CONVERSATION</p><h2>People on<br/><em>the other end.</em></h2><p>Prefer to speak about your requirement first? Contact the team directly.</p><a class="contact-method" href={`https://wa.me/${company.whatsapp}`}><Icon name="chat"/><span><small>WHATSAPP</small>{company.phoneDisplay}</span><Icon name="up-right" size={18}/></a><a class="contact-method" href={`mailto:${company.email}`}><Icon name="mail"/><span><small>EMAIL</small>{company.email}</span></a><div class="contact-note"><h3>Looking for work?</h3><p>The roles shown on this site are examples, not confirmed vacancies. You can ask the team about current opportunities.</p><a class="text-link" href={`https://wa.me/${company.whatsapp}?text=${encodeURIComponent('Hello Victoria, I would like to enquire about current employment opportunities. My role or area of experience is: ')}`}>Enquire about opportunities <Icon size={18}/></a></div></aside>
    <div class="enquiry-panel">
      <div class="form-heading"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR WORKFORCE BRIEF</span><span class="form-step">01 / PREPARE</span></div>
      <div id="jobseeker-notice" class="inline-notice" hidden>Looking for a role? Use “Enquire about opportunities” to contact the team. This form is for employer workforce requirements.</div>
      <form id="enquiry-form" novalidate hidden>
        <p class="form-intro">Tell us what your team needs.<br/><span>Required fields are marked with an asterisk (*).</span></p>
        <div id="form-errors" class="form-errors" tabindex="-1" hidden><h3>Please check your details</h3><ul></ul></div>
        <div class="form-grid">
          <div class="field"><label for="company">Company or employer name *</label><input id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" required maxlength="120"/><span class="field-error" id="company-error"></span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="name">Your name *</label><input id="name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100"/><span class="field-error" id="name-error"></span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="email">Your email *</label><input id="email" name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="180"/><span class="field-error" id="email-error"></span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="phone">Phone / WhatsApp <span>(optional)</span></label><input id="phone" name="phone" type="tel" autocomplete="tel" maxlength="30"/></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="sector">Area of recruitment *</label><select id="sector" name="sector" required><option value="">Select an area</option>{services.map(s=><option value={s.slug}>{s.name}</option>)}<option value="unsure">I’d like to discuss this</option></select><span class="field-error" id="sector-error"></span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="role">Role or trade *</label><input id="role" name="role" placeholder="e.g. Electricians, kitchen helpers" required maxlength="150"/><span class="field-error" id="role-error"></span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="headcount">Number of people *</label><input id="headcount" name="headcount" type="number" min="1" max="10000" step="1" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="e.g. 12" required/><span class="field-error" id="headcount-error"></span></div>
          <div class="field"><label for="location">Work location in Sri Lanka *</label><input id="location" name="location" placeholder="e.g. Colombo" required maxlength="150"/><span class="field-error" id="location-error"></span></div>
          <div class="field full"><label for="timeline">Preferred start period</label><select id="timeline" name="timeline"><option value="To be discussed">To be discussed</option><option>As soon as feasible</option><option>Within 1–3 months</option><option>Within 3–6 months</option><option>More than 6 months from now</option></select><small>A planning preference; availability and timing need to be agreed.</small></div>
          <div class="field full"><label for="message">Anything else we should know? <span>(optional)</span></label><textarea id="message" name="message" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Tell us about skills, duties, working arrangements, or your project."></textarea><small>Please do not include identity documents or sensitive personal information.</small></div>
        </div>
        <label class="consent-label"><input id="consent" name="consent" type="checkbox" required/><span>I have read the <a href="/privacy/">privacy & enquiry information</a> and understand that I choose how to send this brief. *</span></label><span class="field-error" id="consent-error"></span>
        <button class="button form-submit" type="submit">Prepare my enquiry <Icon name="arrow"/></button>
        <p class="form-footnote">Nothing is sent when you prepare your brief. You review it first.</p>
      </form>
      <section id="enquiry-review" hidden aria-labelledby="review-title">
        <p class="eyebrow">02 / REVIEW & SEND</p><h2 id="review-title" tabindex="-1">Your brief is <em>ready.</em></h2><p>It hasn’t been sent yet. Review the details, then choose WhatsApp or your email app to send it to Victoria.</p><pre id="brief-preview"></pre><div class="review-actions"><a id="send-whatsapp" class="button" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Continue to WhatsApp <Icon name="up-right"/></a><a id="send-email" class="button button-outline">Open email draft <Icon name="mail" size={20}/></a></div><p class="form-footnote">You must finish sending in the app you choose. Opening a draft does not confirm delivery.</p><div class="review-secondary"><button id="edit-enquiry" class="text-link" type="button">← Edit details</button><button id="copy-enquiry" class="text-link" type="button">Copy brief</button><button id="download-enquiry" class="text-link" type="button">Download brief <Icon name="download" size={18}/></button></div><p id="copy-status" role="status" class="copy-status"></p>
      </section>
      <p id="enquiry-fallback" class="inline-notice">The brief builder needs JavaScript. You can still contact us directly using the WhatsApp or email links.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <script src="../scripts/enquiry.ts"></script>
</Layout>
